===Etymology===
From {{inh|de|gmh|vels}}, from {{inh|de|goh|felis}}, from {{inh|de|gem-pro|*falisaz}}, from {{der|de|ine-pro|*pels-}}, {{m|ine-pro|*pelis-||rock, cliff}}. Compare {{cog|non|fjall||rock, mountain}}, {{cog|grc|πέλλα||stone}}, {{cog|mga|all||cliff}}. The variant {{m|de|Felsen}} emerged from the oblique cases.

